  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '-Objective

    Your goal is to survive all enemy waves by defending the
    central object. Enemies try to reach it, and each one that succeeds reduces your
    health. If your health reaches zero, the game ends.


    -Shop

    Inside each
    level there is a shop where you can spend your money. The shop allows you to:


    Buy
    new satellites (your main defensive units)


    Upgrade existing satellites
    to increase their effectiveness


    Upgrade your economy to generate money
    faster or more efficiently


    -Orbit speed control

    You can switch between
    slow and fast orbit speeds for your satellites.


    Slow speed allows for more
    controlled and predictable damage.


    Fast speed increases hit frequency but
    requires good timing.


    Changing orbit speed during combat is a core tactical
    tool.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
